{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026M4wicyPtDl1795524344.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國足協發布《紅圖計劃》，其中一個目標是十年內，組成可以與強隊抗衡的國家隊。</p><p></p><p>這份《紅圖計劃》，是由中國足協構建的足球技術發展框架，亦是指導全國青少年足球工作的綱領性技術文件，集中解答如何培養球員、培養甚麼樣的球員等問題。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FOOTBALL-2000-1_CLEAN_20261124_202929.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264q1Ut8BqxU1795524437.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現時國足在全球最新排名是第95位。計劃提到，目標是到2035年基本形成具有中國特色、符合現代足球發展規律的青少年足球技術發展體系，穩定輸送精英球員，並建成能與強隊抗衡的國家隊。</p><p></p><p>中國足協主席宋凱表示，這份計劃是中國足球技術發展的教材，強調中國足球要變好，就要從尊重規律、堅守青訓等開始，必須要長期堅持。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:24:10.535097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T12:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T21:37:50.178992+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T13:17:18.212747+00:00","content_hash":"5a4ca60dd01d2c6ee05a7fa8062fe1c0d16009b3265bf19ba37194f3c1ea3e4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T13:24:10.535097+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}